# Smoothing group test fixture.
#
# Two quads share the edge spanned by vertices 2 and 3. The left quad lies in the XZ
# plane (normal -Y), the right quad is folded up by 90 degrees (normal +X).
#
#   y
#   ^    6----5
#   |    |    |
#   |    |    |
#   | 2--3----+
#   | |  |
#   +-1--4--------> x / z
#
o SmoothFold

v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 0 1
v 0 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 1 1 0

vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1

s 1
f 1/1 2/2 3/3 4/4
f 2/2 6/2 5/3 3/3
